  "finding": "Vinh Phuc Motor Technology Co., Ltd. (contact Pham Thu Ha) sent quotation VPM-Q-260924 on 24 September, offering a drop-in BLDC motor, VPM-86-48-400B, as an equivalent to the YZ-BL86-48-400. The terms are USD 165.54 each at 500 pieces and USD 160.87 each at 1,000 pieces. MOQ is 200, FOB Hai Phong (so Halden would be importer of record), 60 days after PPAP approval, with 4-week free samples. Payment is a 30% deposit and 70% before shipment for the first three orders. No validity date is stated. The sender is not in the supplier master and nothing links it to an existing supplier, so treat it as a new, unvetted sender. Don't reply to the address in the message. It is not a rename, so no supplier link is proposed and nothing is staged. Dana Reyes (Motors) should decide whether to vet the company before any response. The company claims ISO 9001, IATF 16949 in progress, and two European e-scooter customers. The quote can't be used for comparison until the validity date, origin papers and equivalence to the YZ-BL86-48-400 are confirmed.",
